<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">CITY PUBLIC KNOWLEDGE</view><view class="h1">城市资料库</view><view class="sub">住房、工作、教育、医疗、交通与文化。<view>读过正文，再把它们连接起来。</view></view><view class="notice">{{boot.research.documents}} 篇原文已读 · {{boot.research.categories}} 个领域 · {{boot.research.syntheses}} 个跨资料专题</view><view class="search"><input placeholder="生活问题、政策或服务名称…" value="{{q}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="search"/><button bindtap="search">搜索</button></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="chips"><view class="chip {{!category?'active':''}}" data-id="" bindtap="category">全部领域</view><view wx:for="{{boot.categories}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{category===item.id?'active':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="category">{{item.name}}</view></scroll-view><view class="tabs"><button class="{{!kind?'active':''}}" data-id="" bindtap="kind">全部</button><button class="{{kind==='document'?'active':''}}" data-id="document" bindtap="kind">原文资料</button><button class="{{kind==='synthesis'?'active':''}}" data-id="synthesis" bindtap="kind">融合专题</button></view><view class="meta">{{count}} 篇相关内容 · 保留原文日期与适用范围</view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="article"><view class="meta">{{item.kind==='synthesis'?item.sourceCount+'份资料融合':item.documentRead?'原文正文已读':'编辑导航'}} · {{item.publishedAt||'原页未标发布日期'}}</view><view class="title">{{item.title}} ↗</view><view class="body">{{item.preview}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.scope}}" class="scope-note">{{item.scope}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.archivedSource}}" class="warning">归档来源，实际办理前需核实当前规则。</view></view><view wx:if="{{!records.length}}" class="empty">暂时没有相应已收录资料，可更换关键词。</view></view>
